# The inputs of the mainline RC-10a install images of uc-pxx-installer (KIND=release): RC-10 (mainline-rc10-install.inputs,
# INSTALLER_COMMIT 5ce3574) with one fix of uc-pxx-inst only (mainline-rc-10a, unit 4 2026-11-16: Reopen compares the
# plan's schema-3 manifest by value; the install child of a saved plan.json no longer refuses with equal sha256s).
# image/build.sh --install --board both --inputs THIS-FILE, from INSTALLER_COMMIT. Every other value is RC-10's: the gate
# and step2set (the R23 base 0.2.0-rc10-base of uc-pxx-linux r23-base 2d34eed, manifest 3b2755c1), the A/B tool
# uc-pxx-bootctl-inst r3 639b6514, the step-1 USB service uc-pxx-xfer 62421c48 (unchanged bytes), the kernel and the
# tools. The build stops if a value differs. New tokens and time (used by no other inputs file). The images are for no
# unit until the release review names their sha256 and the safety rules name the image and the unit.
